# Cases for t/unit/test_test.cpp, recorded into test.golden by
# test_record.sh. One shell command per line, using only single quotes,
# $'...' and plain words. "#posix " runs the line in POSIX mode. The
# working directory holds the tree built by test_oracle.sh, and the
# variables x empty arr as ref badref are set (see test_oracle.sh).

